4.  **Analyze the Motion (Velocity Vectors):**
    *   The velocity of a swimmer relative to the ground ($\vec{v}_g$) is the sum of their velocity relative to the water ($\vec{v}_w$) and the river velocity ($\vec{v}_r$). $\vec{v}_g = \vec{v}_w + \vec{v}_r$.
