$u_S = -28 - u_M = -28 - (-64) = 36$.

### 4. Finding D

We find $v_M$ using $u_M$:
$v_M^2 = 6400 - u_M^2 = 6400 - (-64)^2 = 6400 - 4096 = 2304$.
$v_M = 48$ m/min (We take the positive root as they swim north).

