$r_6 \in \{0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5\}$

The remainders are not independent due to the relationships between the moduli (e.g., $n \pmod 4$ determines $n \pmod 2$, and $n \pmod 6$ determines $n \pmod 2$ and $n \pmod 3$).

