(Eq. M): $6400 = (-v_S - 28)^2 + K^2 ((-v_S - 28) + 14)^2$
$6400 = (v_S + 28)^2 + K^2 (-v_S - 14)^2$
$6400 = (v_S + 28)^2 + K^2 (v_S + 14)^2$

Now we subtract (Eq. S) from (Eq. M):
