$$3600 - v_{Sx,w}^2 = 6400 - (784 + 56v_{Sx,w} + v_{Sx,w}^2)$$
$$3600 - v_{Sx,w}^2 = 6400 - 784 - 56v_{Sx,w} - v_{Sx,w}^2$$
$$3600 = 5616 - 56v_{Sx,w}$$
$$56v_{Sx,w} = 5616 - 3600$$
$$56v_{Sx,w} = 2016$$
$$v_{Sx,w} = \frac{2016}{56} = 36$$

