$$R(-1) = (-1)^3 + (-1) + 1 = -1 - 1 + 1 = -1$$
So, $\prod_{j=1}^3 (1 + r_j) = -(-1) = 1$.

Finally, substituting these values back into the expression for $P$:
$$P = 8 \cdot (3) \cdot (1) = 24$$

