So, $R(\zeta_3) = \zeta_3 - 1$.

We evaluate $R(\zeta_3^2) = (\zeta_3^2)^7 - 1 = \zeta_3^{14} - 1$.
Since $\zeta_3^{14} = (\zeta_3^3)^4 \cdot \zeta_3^2 = 1^4 \cdot \zeta_3^2 = \zeta_3^2$.
So, $R(\zeta_3^2) = \zeta_3^2 - 1$.

