| Feature | Mundane Event | Emotionally Charged Event |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Brain Signal** | Low Salience | High Salience (Amygdala activation) |
| **Chemicals** | Low Cortisol/Norepinephrine | High Cortisol/Norepinephrine (Memory Tagging) |
| **Encoding** | Simple, linear, low detail | Rich, multi-sensory, highly detailed |
| **Storage** | Fragile, easily forgotten | Robust, consolidated, long-term |
| **Function** | Routine maintenance | Survival and learning |<turn|>
