| **Brain Activity** | Superficial processing; low signal to hippocampus. | Amygdala flags event; powerful signal to hippocampus. |
| **Attention** | Automatic, passive, low focus. | Conscious, intense, deep focus. |
| **Memory Strength** | Weak, easily forgotten (shallow encoding). | Strong, vivid, highly consolidated (deep encoding). |
| **Evolutionary Role** | Low priority; background noise. | High priority; survival information. |<turn|>
